SUMMARY:Dead Parent Society – Chris Groves
LOCATION:Hoots @ Nicolson Square\, 25 Nicolson Square and Nicolson Square G
 ardens\, EH8 9BX\, Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Chris Groves turns grief into something refreshingly uplifting 
 and unexpectedly funny. Blending sharp stand-up with heartfelt honesty in a
  life-affirming hour about loss\, family and finding laughter when you need
  it most. He dives into strange\, awkward and oddly funny moments following
  a loss\, from dealing with practicalities to the unexpected ways grief sho
 ws up in everyday life. Open\, warm\, and genuinely funny\, this is a show 
 for anyone who’s lost someone – or just enjoys laughing at life (and de
 ath). You might not leave healed\, but you will have laughed for a bit!\nMo
 re info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/dead-parent-society-chr
 is-groves/
